  m_Text: Track your booth performance metrics here, including total and unique visitor
    counts, as well as the number of applicants. Update the information users see
    about your business on the right, ensuring it's current and engaging. Use 'Refresh
    Data' to load the latest stats and 'Check Applications' to review candidate submissions.
    To reset the visitor counters, use the reset buttons.
